`+ee("AI-generated content is intended to assist, not replace, human judgment.","Educational, academic, administrative, disciplinary, or policy decisions should always be reviewed and approved by authorized school personnel.","Users are responsible for verifying the accuracy, suitability, and appropriateness of AI-generated outputs before relying upon them.","EduAItor continuously improves its AI capabilities; however, AI-generated responses may occasionally contain inaccuracies or incomplete information.")+`

